          <div class="pmc-split__content">
            <span class="pmc-tag">Technology in capacity building</span>
            <h2 class="pmc-heading">Purpose-built for government capacity building programmes at scale.</h2>
            <p class="pmc-subheading">SONIC is PMC's proprietary training management platform, built to manage large-scale government training programmes with real-time tracking, digital assessments, and end-to-end visibility across states and districts.</p>
          </div>
          <figure class="pmc-split__media">
